t-meta {\n      text-align: right;\n      line-height: 1.45;\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"page\">\n    <div class=\"hero\">\n      <span>[illegible] - Boikarabelo</span>\n      <span class=\"sub\">[illegible] - Bophelo bja gago</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"orb orb-1\"></div>\n    <div class=\"orb orb-2\"></div>\n    <div class=\"orb orb-3\"></div>\n    <div class=\"orb orb-4\"></div>\n    <div class=\"orb orb-5\"></div>\n\n    <div class=\"placeholder illustration illustration-1\" aria-label=\"Illustration: food and hand hygiene\">\n      <span>[Illustration]</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"placeholder illustration illustration-2\" aria-label=\"Illustration: separate food\">\n      <span>[Illustration]</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"placeholder illustration illustration-3\" aria-label=\"Illustration: cooking food\">\n      <span>[Illustration]</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"placeholder illustration illustration-4\" aria-label=\"Illustration: temperature warning\">\n      <span>[Illustration]</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"placeholder illustration illustration-5\" aria-label=\"Illustration: safe water and raw materials\">\n      <span>[Illustration]</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"symbol symbol-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n    <div class=\"symbol symbol-2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n    <div class=\"symbol symbol-3\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n\n    <div class=\"danger\">\n      Danger<br>Zone!\n      <small>5°C&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;60°C</small>\n    </div>\n\n    <section class=\"band band-1\">\n      <h2>Boloka bohlweki</h2>\n      <div class=\"band-content\">\n        <div>\n          <ul>\n            <li>Hlapa diatla tša gago pele o swara dijo le go di lokiša</li>\n            <li>[illegible] diatla tša gago ka nako ya go lokiša dijo</li>\n            <li>Hlapa diatla tša gago ka morago ga go ya ntlwaneng</li>\n            <li>[illegible]</li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <p>[illegible] tša gago di swara dijo le go di lokiša.</p>\n          <p>[illegible] di ka ba le bolwetši, alafa mo le go hlatswa diatla.</p>\n          <p>[illegible] boloka lefelo la go lokišetša dijo le hlwekile.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"band band-2\">\n      <h2>Aroganya dijo tšeo di apeilwego le tše tala</h2>\n      <div class=\"band-content\">\n        <div>\n          <ul>\n            <li>Aroganya dijo tše tala le tše di apeilwego</li>\n            <li>Šomiša didirišwa tše di fapanego go swara dijo tše tala</li>\n            <li>Boloka dijo tše tala ka thoko ga dijo tše di apeilwego</li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <p>[illegible] dijo tše tala di ka ba le dipaketeria tše kotsi.</p>\n          <p>[illegible] ge di kopana le dijo tše di apeilwego.</p>\n          <p>[illegible] boloka dijo tše di apeilwego di šireletšegile.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"band band-3\">\n      <h2>Apeša dijo ka botlalo</h2>\n      <div class=\"band-content\">\n        <div>\n          <ul>\n            <li>Apea dijo tšeo di apeilwego ka botlalo</li>\n            <li>Dira gore dijo tše bjalo ka nama di fiše go fihla gare</li>\n            <li>Go na le dijo tšeo di apeilwego gabotse</li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <p>Apea dijo tšeo go swanetšego gore di fiše ka botlalo.</p>\n          <p>[illegible] ge dijo di apeilwe gabotse, dipaketeria di a bolawa.</p>\n          <p>[illegible] dijo tšeo di šetšego di apeilwe.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"band band-4\">\n      <h2>Boloka dijo mo themperetšheng e bolokegilego</h2>\n      <div class=\"band-content\">\n        <div>\n          <ul>\n            <li>O seke wa bea dijo tše di apeilwego le tše tala ka themperetšheng e tee</li>\n            <li>Dijo ka moka tšeo di apeilwego di swanetše go ba ka tlase ga 5°C</li>\n            <li>Boloka dijo tše di fišago di fiša, gomme tše di tonya di tonya</li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <p>O seke wa bea dijo tša go fiša kgauswi le dijo tše dingwe.</p>\n          <p>[illegible] themperetšha ya go boloka dijo e bolokegile.</p>\n          <p>[illegible] dijo mo setšidifatšing ge go kgonega.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"band band-5\">\n      <h2>Šomiša meetse a hlwekilego le dijo tše botse</h2>\n      <div class=\"band-content\">\n        <div>\n          <ul>\n            <li>Šomiša meetse a bolokegilego</li>\n            <li>Kgetha dijo tše foreše le tše botse</li>\n            <li>Hlatswa dienywa le merogo pele o di ja</li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <p>Dijo tšeo di apeilwego le meetse di swanetše go ba tše di šireletšegilego.</p>\n          <p>[illegible] dijo tše di senyegilego.</p>\n          <p>[illegible] hlatswa dijo pele di apewa.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <footer class=\"footer\">\n      <div class=\"south-africa\">\n        <div class=\"sa-emblem\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n        <div>\n          <strong>health</strong>\n          <span>Department:<br>Health</span>\n          <b>REPUBLIC OF SOUTH AFRICA</b>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"who\">\n        <div class=\"who-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n        <div>\n          <strong>Food Safety</strong>\n          <strong>World Health Organization</strong>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"document-title\">Tsebo + Maikarabelo = bophelo</div>\n\n      <div class=\"document-meta\">\n        WHO/SDE/PHE/FOS/01.1<br>\n        Distribution: General<br>\n        Original: English\n      </div>\n    </footer>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>"
